  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/816/77/logo.png\" alt=\"標誌\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/3AvrppcgG3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e7d437cbe00c4c4d693900b0e41e3a293a84a31b.png\" alt=\"Discord 連結\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fto0pa.net%252fdonate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e79bfe6b479f2a23fad07b79b13d88d027ae422e.png\" alt=\"捐贈\"></a>\n<strong>✨節慶盛宴</strong></p>\n<p>《節慶盛宴》為《農夫的豐收》添加了節慶馴養食物</p>\n<p><strong>🎅聖誕節</strong></p>\n<p>聖誕快樂！\n本模組的聖誕章節新增了肉桂，可用於製作薑餅與聖誕茶。\n你可以在針葉林生物群系中發現肉桂叢。\n使用擀麵棍和模具來製作薑餅餅乾和薑餅人！\n圍著壁爐享受你的全新聖誕雞吧。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AsUUCoXX/images/8ef037feed91ec3fc602f44902a7a0880520698b.png\" alt=\"房屋\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AsUUCoXX/images/d0016548a7b94264682debdd8e6f5cd2d52097a8.png\" alt=\"介面\"></p>\n<p>==== 贊助商 ====</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fwrench\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/060ea25c304c36bb48e61db95e82269d2bc69c2a.png\" alt=\"贊助商\"></a></p>",
